{:edb/db-before-t 2180 :edb/db-after-t 2181 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535493 50 #inst "2026-10-09T01:11:35.737Z" 13194139535493 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186351885 13194139535493 true] [17592186064399 1100 "$\\int (x+3)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535493 true] [17592186064399 1100 "What is $\\displaystyle \\int(x + 3)\\cos (3x)dx$?" 13194139535493 false] [17592186064399 1145 "Take $u=x+3$ and $dv=\\cos(3x)\\,dx$. Then $du=dx$ and $v=\\sin(3x)/3$. Thus\n$$\\int(x+3)\\cos(3x)\\,dx=\\frac{(x+3)\\sin(3x)}3-\\frac13\\int\\sin(3x)\\,dx\n=\\frac{(x+3)\\sin(3x)}3+\\frac{\\cos(3x)}9+C.$$" 13194139535493 false] [17592186064399 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x+3)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x+3\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x+3)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =(x+3)\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x+3)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\text{d}x & =\\frac{(x+3)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{(x+3)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{9}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351886 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1089 "q-349217" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2}3x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1113 #uuid "24fe0b51-6352-5f7d-ac11-80fbb39fffe2" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351885 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=3x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=3 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{2x} & ⇒ & v=\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 3x\\cdot {e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =3x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2x}-\\int \\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2x}\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}3x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{3}{2}x{e}^{2x}\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}x{e}^{2x}\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-\\frac{3}{4}{e}^{2x}\\,{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}(2\\cdot {e}^{4}-0\\cdot {e}^{0})-\\frac{3}{4}({e}^{4}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =3{e}^{4}-\\frac{3}{4}({e}^{4}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{9{e}^{4}+3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351887 13194139535493 true] [17592186351886 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535493 true] [17592186351886 1041 "field-1" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351886 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351887 13194139535493 true] [17592186351886 1110 #uuid "2f50aba1-c314-5a83-8359-d16e3fe2c6a6" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351887 1034 "\\frac{9}{4}e^4+\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139535493 true] [17592186351887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535493 true] [17592186351887 1111 #uuid "b921defa-1211-5826-a8e9-e8b187eee7f6" 13194139535493 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-349217" 17592186351885 "q-349217/field-1" 17592186351886 "q-349217/field-1/4bf78ee97047b11e3f0b99df1d2ac8693ecb270ef81d2b88779d50c1336da4f9" 17592186351887} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
